    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref61" />
    <bp:xref rdf:resource="#UnificationXref62" />
    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In PMNs, cytosolic phospholipid hydroperoxide glutathione peroxidase (GPX4 isoform 2, GPX4-2) (Yagi et al. 1996) is a likely candidate for the reduction of organic hydroperoxides such as 18(S)-HpEPE to 18(S)-hydroxyeicosapentaenoic acid (18(S)-HEPE) (Han et al. 2013) using glutathione (GSH) as an electron donor (Brigelius-Flohe &amp; Maiorino 2013).</bp:comment>
