    <bp:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To produce their pro-resolving effects, 18(S)-RvE1, E2 and E3 are released into the exudate of local inflammation sites (Serhan et al. 2000). The mechanism of translocation is unknown.</bp:comment>
